        "text": "<thinking> To create the object_metadata.py file that reads object metadata from a managed object storage service, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I will use Amazon S3 as the provider because it is a widely used managed object storage service. I will import the boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, to interact with S3. The code will include the boto3 import and the use of the S3 client to fetch object metadata, making the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
